#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:368
msgid "反直觉案例"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:370
msgid "以下是一些容易让初学者走弯路的常见误区："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:372
msgid "案例一：为什么\"加更多层\"不一定好？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:374
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{doc}`../image-net-era/res-net` 展示了退化问题：56 层网络比 20 层更差。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:376
msgid "**直觉错误**：深度 = 表达力，所以越深越好。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:378
msgid "**真相**：深度增加表达力，但也增加优化难度。没有跳跃连接的 56 层网络信息早已丢失殆尽——不是\"没学到\"，而是\"根本谈不上学习\"。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:380
msgid "**启示**：加深度之前，先保证信息通路。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:382
msgid "案例二：为什么参数少反而更好？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:384
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"GoogLeNet 6.8M 参数，远少于 VGG 的 138M，但效果更好。{doc}`../image-net-era/inception` "
"已经展示了这点。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:386
msgid "**直觉错误**：参数 = 能力，所以参数多一定好。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:388
msgid "**真相**：参数多意味着搜索空间大，更难优化。精巧的归纳偏置（多尺度、跳跃连接）比暴力堆参数更有效。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:390
msgid "**启示**：追求\"优雅\"而非\"庞大\"。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:392
msgid "案例三：注意力总是越多越好？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:394
msgid "**直觉错误**：注意力就是好，越多越强。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:396
msgid ""
"**真相**：注意力增加计算，且不同类型的注意力适用场景不同。通道注意力（SE-"
"Net）几乎通用——因为\"调整特征通道的权重\"在分类、检测、分割中都有效，代价极小。但空间注意力（CBAM）和自注意力（Non-"
"local）就有取舍了：对于 MNIST 这种信息密度高的简单任务，几乎所有位置都很关键，空间注意力几乎没有增益；而在 COCO "
"等复杂场景中，需要定位目标位置，空间注意力的提升才显著。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:398
msgid "**启示**：通道注意力是\"默认推荐\"——代价极低、几乎稳定提升；空间注意力和自注意力则是\"按需使用\"——只在信息过剩、需要选择性关注时才有意义。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:400
msgid "改造十诫"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:402
msgid "架构设计心法十诫"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:405
msgid "**观察先行，再动刀**。看训练曲线、梯度分布、各类别准确率，不要凭感觉改。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:407
msgid "**从简到繁，逐步验证**。每次只改一个变量，否则你永远不知道哪个改动真正有效。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:409
msgid "**先修信息通路，再增信息容量**。先保证跳跃连接，再考虑加深度。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:411
msgid "**感受野与目标大小匹配**。目标大 → 大感受野，目标小 → 小感受野，都有 → 多尺度。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:413
msgid "**注意力解决\"不知道看哪\"，不是万能药**。先看信息有没有、通路通不通，再决定注意力。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:415
msgid "**效率优先，延迟优化**。先跑出好结果，再考虑加速。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:417
msgid "**多尺度是永恒主题**。无论感受野、FPN 还是注意力，核心都是\"不要只用一个尺度\"。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:419
msgid "**不迷信新技术**。新技术 = 新归纳偏置，关键看它解决了什么信息论问题。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:421
msgid "**外部变量先排除**。学习率、优化器、数据预处理出错的概率比架构问题大多了。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:423
msgid "**保持怀疑**。论文里的 SOTA 架构可能不适用你的场景。没有\"最好\"的架构，只有\"最适合\"的架构。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:426
msgid "心法实践：一个改造示例"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:428
msgid "下面是一个简短的示例——在一个基础 CNN 上同时应用跳跃连接、SE 注意力和 DW 卷积："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:430
msgid ""
"import torch\n"
"import torch.nn as nn\n"
"\n"
"class ModifiedBlock(nn.Module):\n"
"    \"\"\"融合了三个维度改造策略的基础模块\"\"\"\n"
"    def __init__(self, in_ch, out_ch, stride=1, expansion=4):\n"
"        super().__init__()\n"
"        hidden_ch = out_ch // expansion\n"
"        \n"
"        # 维度四（效率）：Bottleneck 降维\n"
"        self.conv1 = nn.Conv2d(in_ch, hidden_ch, 1, bias=False)\n"
"        self.bn1 = nn.BatchNorm2d(hidden_ch)\n"
"        \n"
"        # 维度四（效率）：DW 卷积——空间和通道分离\n"
"        self.dwconv = nn.Conv2d(hidden_ch, hidden_ch, 3, stride, \n"
"                                 padding=1, groups=hidden_ch, bias=False)"
"\n"
"        self.bn2 = nn.BatchNorm2d(hidden_ch)\n"
"        \n"
"        self.conv2 = nn.Conv2d(hidden_ch, out_ch, 1, bias=False)\n"
"        self.bn3 = nn.BatchNorm2d(out_ch)\n"
"        \n"
"        # 维度三（注意力）：SE 模块——知道哪个通道重要\n"
"        self.se = nn.Sequential(\n"
"            nn.AdaptiveAvgPool2d(1),\n"
"            nn.Conv2d(out_ch, out_ch // 4, 1),  # r=4 降维\n"
"            nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n"
"            nn.Conv2d(out_ch // 4, out_ch, 1),  # 升维\n"
"            nn.Sigmoid()\n"
"        )\n"
"        \n"
"        # 维度二（深度与连接）：跳跃连接——信息流动的退路\n"
"        self.skip = nn.Identity() if stride == 1 and in_ch == out_ch else"
" \\\n"
"                    nn.Sequential(nn.Conv2d(in_ch, out_ch, 1, stride, "
"bias=False),\n"
"                                  nn.BatchNorm2d(out_ch))\n"
"    \n"
"    def forward(self, x):\n"
"        residual = self.skip(x)\n"
"        \n"
"        out = self.conv1(x)\n"
"        out = self.bn1(out)\n"
"        out = nn.ReLU(inplace=True)(out)\n"
"        \n"
"        out = self.dwconv(out)\n"
"        out = self.bn2(out)\n"
"        out = nn.ReLU(inplace=True)(out)\n"
"        \n"
"        out = self.conv2(out)\n"
"        out = self.bn3(out)\n"
"        \n"
"        out = out * self.se(out)  # 通道注意力：每个通道乘一个 0~1 重要性系数\n"
"        \n"
"        out += residual           # 跳跃连接：从不衰减的梯度通道\n"
"        return nn.ReLU(inplace=True)(out)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part6-diagnosis.md:486
msgid ""
"**心法与代码的对应**：跳跃连接保证梯度通路 → `residual`；SE 注意力选择重要通道 → `se(out)`；DW 卷积降低计算量 "
"→ `groups=hidden_ch`；Bottleneck 降维执行 → `out_ch // 4`。"
msgstr ""

